      470
    ],
    "total_f": 6.2e-07,
    "max_part_irms_a": 8.507223473865299,
    "reason": "lands exactly on the design capacitance with the fewest parts, so the Lr trim target stays the nominal 0.92 uH external; the parts are unequal, so ripple divides in proportion to capacitance rather than equally, and the 470 nF part carries 8.51 A rms"
  },
