  "caveats": [
    "ripple divides in proportion to capacitance only while the parts are still capacitive at 200 kHz; above their self-resonance the split follows impedance, which is not modelled",
    "bank ESR = part ESR / N ignores interconnect resistance; at 2-3 parts that is small but unmeasured",
    "the 100 A operating point was simulated at 620 nF and 1.0 uH total only; a landing at 600 nF changes the tank gain at the fixed clock and needs its own run before it replaces the design point",
    "self-heating, dV/dt rating and lifetime of the film parts are not modelled anywhere here",
    "the capacitance band assumes the Lr trim window 0.875-1.0 uH external is the evidence window; a total inductance outside 1.0-1.08 uH has not been run at the 100 A point"
  ]
}
